# Official guía framework — Creación Digital I–II

> **These JSON files are the institutional contract.** Every CV, unit forge, `tracks.yml` hour allocation, and evaluation claim must reconcile to them. Do not invent FE-style 10/30/14 splits. Do not invent competencies or contents.

## Canonical sources (in-repo clones)

| Course | Path | Upstream scrape | PDF |
| ------ | ---- | --------------- | --- |
| **CD I** | [`cv/guides/1-creacion-digital-i.json`](./cv/guides/1-creacion-digital-i.json) | `unicrawler/output/guides/1-creacion-digital-i.json` | [9729001103.pdf](https://universidadeuropea.es/myfiles/pr/9729001103.pdf) |
| **CD II** | [`cv/guides/3-creacion-digital-ii.json`](./cv/guides/3-creacion-digital-ii.json) | `unicrawler/output/guides/3-creacion-digital-ii.json` | [9729001108.pdf](https://universidadeuropea.es/myfiles/pr/9729001108.pdf) |

**Re-sync:** copy from unicrawler when the university republishes; keep provenance note in [`cv/README.md`](./cv/README.md). Prefer PDF check if JSON and PDF disagree — flag the conflict, do not silently invent.

**Default modality for authoring:** `Modalidad presencial` (Campus Creativo). Virtual tables exist in the JSON and must be respected if a virtual delivery is ever claimed — never mix presencial hours with virtual labels.

