## 1. Identity fields (must appear in every CV / track header)

Read verbatim from JSON: `subject_name`, `official_title_name`, `school_or_faculty`, `year`, `ects`, `module_type`, `languages`, `modality`, `semester`, `academic_year`, `coordinating_professor`, `presentation`, `source_url`.

| | CD I | CD II |
| - | ---- | ----- |
| Semester | **1** | **2** |
| ECTS | **6** | **6** |
| Year | **1** | **1** |
| Module | Básica | Básica |
