## 4. Methodologies (`methodologies.General`)

Only claim methods that appear in the JSON (clase magistral, ABP, proyectos, taller, simulación, etc.). CD II’s scraped list is partially concatenated in one string — when citing, prefer the discrete names also present in CD I.

