Virtual modality tables live in the same JSON files — use them only for virtual delivery claims. CD I virtual sums to **150 h**; CD II virtual **150 h**.

**Contact-forgeable bucket** (what unit forge allocates across sessions): magistral (CD II only) + seminarios + resolución de problemas + proyectos + talleres/labs + debates. **Not session-forged:** trabajo autónomo, tutoría, pruebas de evaluación (institutional totals; keep as course-level residuals).

