## 6. Evaluation weights (mandatory)

### CD I — presencial

| Instrument | Weight |
| ---------- | -----: |
| Pruebas de evaluación presenciales | 55% |
| Caso/problema | 20% |
| Proyectos | 10% |

> 🔴 **Scrape defect:** presencial weights sum to **85%**. Virtual sums to 100% (adds Informes y escritos 15%). When authoring the CV, **verify against the PDF** before inventing the missing 15%. Prefer restoring the PDF’s fourth instrument over guessing.

### CD II — presencial (sums **100%**)

| Instrument | Weight |
| ---------- | -----: |
